  <dc:creator>August Lundholm</dc:creator>
  <link>https://aulund.github.io/blog/posts/how-to-make-a-quarto-blog/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>Welcome to your new Quarto blog post!</p>
<section id="steps-to-create-a-quarto-blog" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="steps-to-create-a-quarto-blog">Steps to Create a Quarto Blog</h2>
<ol type="1">
<li>Install Quarto: https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/</li>
<li>Create a new project folder.</li>
<li>Add a <code>_quarto.yml</code> configuration file.</li>
<li>Create posts in the <code>posts/</code> directory, each in its own folder with an <code>index.qmd</code> file.</li>
<li>Customize your blog with themes and CSS.</li>
<li>Render your site with <code>quarto render</code>.</li>
</ol>
<p>Happy blogging!</p>



</section>

